// trainCabinCounts: the people in each car of the active passenger run. Real riders are the Life actors who
// boarded at the berth: still standing at the open doors (TrainPassengers of this run) or already departed
// with it (TrainDispatch.Riders). Background passengers come from cabinBackground. Coarse by design (doc 09,
// 11.11): counts only, no bodies or paths inside the car.
